      "writtenOn": "2024-04-10T07:28:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason to require a permission to create a transform? The only things apps can do with transforms is apply them to things. But creating those things requires the permission anyway. So allowing a app to create a transform doesn\u0027t actually allow it to do anything if it doesn\u0027t have the INTERNET permission. Am I missing something?",
      "parentUuid": "e28bd251_f0b911a0",
      "revId": "28d613d672e84c9584a5d2a5b3c53595f3f4c449",
